    <name>Staumauer Bertoldsheim Runde von Donaualtwasser Schnödhof</name>
    <desc>Distance: 8.368km, Estimated duration: 2.11h, Elevation up: 12.637271479156766m, Elevation down: 12.23490088373029m, Grade: moderate</desc>
